# OMG E2E validation: keep delivery commit to project files only.
# The workflow pushes `git add -A -- .`; these entries stop runner
# state, secrets, logs, and nested checkouts from leaking into the
# immutable project branch (see OMG-E2E-PROGRESS.md section 8).
node_modules/
.opencode/
.opencode-web/
.opencode-ssh/
.agents/
.agentsweb/
.omgithub-runtime/
opencode-agentsweb-id_ed25519
opencode-agentsweb-id_ed25519.pub
# Generic runtime secrets/logs the push sweep (`git add -A`) must never catch.
*.log
*.pid
.env
access.env
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
